Tue Oct 27 16:00:00 UTC 2026 - ahjolinna <ahjolinna@yahoo.com>

- Discover shows one System updates row and the zypper download size.
- Pass -y and --auto-agree-with-licenses after the zypper subcommand.
  Slowroll has no delta RPMs.
- Set PATH before transactional-update. packagekitd clears the
  environment, and the helper needs /usr/sbin for btrfs and tukit.
- dup still stages a new snapshot and does not reboot.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Oct 26 23:45:00 UTC 2026 - ahjolinna <ahjolinna@yahoo.com>

- Never report a blank PackageKit error. An empty zypper failure now
  says the command produced no output and includes the exit code.
- Leave the offline-update stub. PreparedUpgrade invalidation is
  packagekit-qt after packagekitd drops off the bus.

